## SECTION 1: SHELL & NAVIGATION (Global Layout)
**Scope:** The persistent frame surrounding all tabs. Includes Sidebar, Top Header, Bottom Footer (Mobile), and Global State Managers.

### 1.1. Visual Structure & CSS Variables
**Theme Engine:** Cyber-OLED Dark Mode (Default).
**Root Variables (`:root` in CSS):**
```css
:root {
  /* Backgrounds */
  --bg-base: #0B0E14;       /* Deepest background */
  --bg-surface: #121721;    /* Card/Sidebar background */
  --bg-surface-hover: #18202E; /* Hover state */
  
  /* Borders & Dividers */
  --border-dim: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
  --border-focus: rgba(0, 245, 160, 0.4);
  
  /* Accents (Status Colors) */
  --accent-health: #00F5A0; /* Green: OK, Active, Up */
  --accent-warn: #F59E0B;   /* Amber: High Load, Idle, Warning */
  --accent-crit: #EF4444;   /* Red: Down, Error, Critical */
  --accent-flow: #06B6D4;   /* Cyan: Network, Data Flow */
  
  /* Typography */
  --text-main: #F9FAFB;
  --text-muted: #94A3B8;
  --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
  --font-sans: 'Inter', sans-serif;
}
```

### 1.2. Component: Top Header (`#global-header`)
**Position:** Fixed top, full width, height `60px`, z-index `100`.
**Layout:** Flexbox (Space-between).

*   **Left Zone (Brand & Status):**
    *   `Logo`: SVG Icon (Ward Eye/Baton), size `32x32`.
    *   `Title`: Text "WARD", font-weight `700`, size `18px`.
    *   `Pulse Indicator`: `<span class="status-dot live">`. CSS animation `pulse 2s infinite`. Color `--accent-health`. Tooltip: "Live Telemetry (1s)".
    *   `Version Badge`: Small text `v1.2.0`, color `--text-muted`.

*   **Center Zone (Global Controls - Desktop Only):**
    *   `Refresh Rate Switcher`: Segmented control `[1s] [3s] [Pause]`. Default `1s`. Updates global variable `POLLING_INTERVAL_MS`.
    *   `Search Bar`: Global instant search (filters current tab table). Placeholder "Search processes, ports...".

*   **Right Zone (Actions & Alerts):**
    *   `Notification Bell`: Icon 🔔. 
        *   **Badge:** Red circle with count of unread `severity: 'crit'` events from `EventEngine`. Hidden if 0.
        *   **Action:** Click opens `#notification-drawer` (Slide-in panel from right).
    *   `Theme Toggle`: Icon 🌙/☀️. Switches between `dark-oled` and `light-mode` (adds class `.theme-light` to body).
    *   `User Menu`: Avatar/Icon. Dropdown: `Settings`, `Logout`, `Export Config`.

### 1.3. Component: Sidebar Navigation (`#main-sidebar`)
**Position:** Fixed left, width `240px` (Desktop), `0px` (Mobile/Collapsed).
**Behavior:** 
*   **Desktop:** Always visible unless toggled. Hover effect expands icons if collapsed.
*   **Mobile/TMA (<768px):** Hidden by default. Replaced by **Bottom Navigation Bar**.

**Navigation Items (Array `NAV_ITEMS`):**
```javascript
const NAV_ITEMS = [
  { id: 'overview', label: 'Overview', icon: '📊', route: '#overview' },
  { id: 'processes', label: 'Processes', icon: '⚡', route: '#processes' },
