## SECTION 2: OVERVIEW DASHBOARD (`#tab-overview`)
**Scope:** The default landing view. Provides a high-level, real-time health summary of the entire system. Focus on "Glanceability" — user must understand system status in < 3 seconds.

### 2.1. Layout Grid System
**Container:** `#overview-grid`
**CSS Grid Definition:**
```css
#overview-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); /* 4 columns on Desktop */
  gap: 16px;
  padding: 20px;
}

/* Responsive Breakpoints */
@media (max-width: 1200px) { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } /* Tablet */
@media (max-width: 768px) { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } /* Mobile/TMA */
```

**Card Spanning Rules:**
*   Standard Cards (CPU, RAM, Swap, Disk): `grid-column: span 1`.
*   Wide Cards (Network, Connections): `grid-column: span 2` (Desktop), `span 1` (Mobile).
*   Full Width Cards (Alerts/Summary): `grid-column: 1 / -1`.

